WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Choose CyberRealistic LCM and the 512 × 512 Quality profile. Image generation runs locally.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.367
Select the Photorealistic style for natural light and photographic detail.

3
00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:11.367
Describe your image: a portrait in golden-hour light, coastal cliffs and an 85 mm photographic look.

4
00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:14.567
Q-Dream generates on the device with airplane mode enabled. Waiting time has been shortened in this demo.

5
00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:20.267
Open the generated portrait to inspect the image in the app viewer.

6
00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:24.233
Image details show the actual model, eight steps and the recorded generation time.

7
00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:27.967
Try a different scene: Tokyo after rain, cyan and magenta neon, reflections and cinematic light.

8
00:00:27.967 --> 00:00:34.900
A second image, also generated locally with CyberRealistic. Tap to view it full screen.

9
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:39.233
Save the finished image to the device vault, ready to use in your own projects.
